{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Here is a comprehensive, text-based AI developer prompt meticulously crafted to replicate the layout, styles, color palette, and full content of **image_b53664.jpg**.
    
    It is structured with editable schema settings and block loops so you can change text or swap bullet points directly inside the Shopify Customizer.
    
    ---
    
    ## The AI Prompt
    
    ```text
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, custom dual-card feature grid section based entirely on the visual layout, spacing, and copy structure shown in the reference "image_b53664.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the current theme's typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard layout maximum width rules (e.g., matching your storefront's `.page-width` or `.container` layout wrappers), and native side padding.
    - **Header Text Formatting:** Use deep navy blue text for headings and subheadings.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop screens, the section displays a top header group centered above a 2-column horizontal card grid. On mobile viewports, the layout must stack vertically with equal spacing.
    
    ### 2. Section Header Group
    Centered at the top of the section layout:
    - **Main Heading:** "Positioning & Focus" (Large, bold, dark navy).
    - **Subheading:** "Understanding what Flow is—and what we deliberately are not—clarifies how we serve retail operations." (Muted gray text, centered, with comfortable line-height and max-width bounds to prevent awkward text wrapping).
    
    ### 3. Dual-Card Architecture & Specific Styles
    The layout features two distinct parallel feature blocks side by side. Each card must have smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px) and an ultra-subtle border line.
    
    - **Left Card Block ("What Flow Is"):**
      - **Background Styling:** Light, soft lime-green gradient tint or solid wash (#A0B842 opacity/tint or light pastel lime wash) shifting subtly into a creamy white.
      - **Card Header Group:** Features an inline flex layout containing:
        - A vibrant lime-green square badge with rounded corners (border-radius: 8px) containing a crisp white concentric target/bullseye inline SVG icon.
        - Title Text: "What Flow Is" (Bold, prominent, dark navy).
      - **Bullet Point Items List:** A vertical column of 4 list items. Each item uses a custom solid olive/lime-green circular bullet point marker, a bold dark-navy item header, and a smaller muted-gray explanatory text string nested cleanly beneath it.
    
    - **Right Card Block ("What Flow Is Not"):**
      - **Background Styling:** Clean, ultra-light desaturated gray-blue background wash or solid crisp light gray pill style.
      - **Card Header Group:** Features an inline flex layout containing:
        - A soft muted-gray square badge with rounded corners containing a gray shield outline inline SVG icon.
        - Title Text: "What Flow Is Not" (Bold, prominent, dark navy).
      - **Bullet Point Items List:** A vertical column of 4 list items. Each item uses a custom solid dark-slate/gray circular bullet point marker, a bold dark-navy item header, and a smaller muted-gray explanatory text string nested cleanly beneath it.
    
    ### 4. Exact Content Text Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the default schema presets or output fields perfectly transcribe all copy verbatim from image_b53664.jpg:
    
    #### LEFT CARD ITEMS:
    1. **Header:** Retail Operational Infrastructure
       - **Description:** Platform for measuring, analyzing, and optimizing physical retail operations
    2. **Header:** Analytics & Execution Platform
       - **Description:** Real-time insights connected to daily store operations and execution
    3. **Header:** Measurement-First System
       - **Description:** Accurate visitor counting, zone analytics, and conversion tracking
    4. **Header:** Enterprise Retail Software
       - **Description:** Multi-store deployment, role-based access, integration-ready
    
    #### RIGHT CARD ITEMS:
    1. **Header:** Not a Dashboard Company
       - **Description:** Charts are outputs, not the product. Flow is operational infrastructure.
    2. **Header:** Not a Hardware Company
       - **Description:** Cameras are sensors, not the solution. Value is in measurement accuracy and platform.
    3. **Header:** Not an AI Chatbot
       - **Description:** AI enables measurement. The product is reliable operational data and execution tools.
    4. **Header:** Not Security Surveillance
       - **Description:** Flow measures behavior, not identity. Privacy-first, no facial recognition.
    
    ### 5. Liquid Schema & Custom CSS Requirements
    - Make all titles, subheadings, card titles, icons, and list rows completely editable by creating structured list blocks (`blocks`) inside the section schema. 
    - All custom CSS styles must be tightly scoped using the `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}` handle to guarantee absolutely zero layout or style leaking across your store pages.
    
    ```
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--page-width, 1600px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px var(--spacing-large, 40px);
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, 'Inter', sans-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__card--left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.left_card_bg }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__card--right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.right_card_bg }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__badge--left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.left_badge_bg }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__badge--right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.right_badge_bg }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, 'Inter', sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__bullet--left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.left_bullet_color }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__bullet--right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.right_bullet_color }};
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__item-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__item-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, 'Inter', sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .ai-positioning-focus__item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, 'Inter', sans-serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px var(--spacing-medium, 24px);
    }


    .ai-positioning-focus__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px var(--spacing-small, 16px);
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-positioning-focus__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-positioning-focus__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <p class="ai-positioning-focus__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="ai-positioning-focus__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-positioning-focus__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__card--left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-positioning-focus__card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__badge--left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ block.settings.left_icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-positioning-focus__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.left_card_title }}</h3>
      </div>
      <ul class="ai-positioning-focus__list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% assign header_key = 'left_item_' | append: i | append: '_header' %}
          {% assign desc_key = 'left_item_' | append: i | append: '_description' %}
          {% assign header = block.settings[header_key] %}
          {% assign description = block.settings[desc_key] %}
          {% if header != blank %}
            <li class="ai-positioning-focus__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-positioning-focus__bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__bullet--left-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></span>
              <div class="ai-positioning-focus__item-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h4 class="ai-positioning-focus__item-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ header }}</h4>
                {% if description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-positioning-focus__item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-positioning-focus__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__card--right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-positioning-focus__card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-positioning-focus__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__badge--right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ block.settings.right_icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-positioning-focus__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.right_card_title }}</h3>
      </div>
      <ul class="ai-positioning-focus__list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% assign header_key = 'right_item_' | append: i | append: '_header' %}
          {% assign desc_key = 'right_item_' | append: i | append: '_description' %}
          {% assign header = block.settings[header_key] %}
          {% assign description = block.settings[desc_key] %}
          {% if header != blank %}
            <li class="ai-positioning-focus__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-positioning-focus__bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-positioning-focus__bullet--right-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></span>
              <div class="ai-positioning-focus__item-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h4 class="ai-positioning-focus__item-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ header }}</h4>
                {% if description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-positioning-focus__item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PositioningFocus{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }
    customElements.define('positioning-focus-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PositioningFocus{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

